LICENSE SCOPE AND THIRD-PARTY EXCEPTION

The WTFPL below applies only to the original source code, tests, build files,
and documentation created for NuclearReactor Web.

It does NOT apply to third-party or historical original material committed
alongside the reimplementation. Excluded material includes, without
limitation:

  - NuclearReactor_1_2.exe;
  - NucReact_1_1.jpg;
  - screenshots derived from the original Windows application; and
  - any other material identified as originating from the historical
    NuclearReactor programs.

The historical NuclearReactor programs were written by
Prof. Horst-Michael Prasser and published by the former
KTG e. V., Sektion Sachsen. No explicit license for those original programs
or artifacts has been found. Their copyright and all applicable rights remain
with their respective rights holders. Their presence in this repository does
not grant permission to copy, modify, redistribute, or relicense them.

This notice is part of the licensing terms for this repository and takes
precedence over the WTFPL text below when determining which files it covers.


